## Key Changes

✅ **Added `init()` action** - Sets up a watcher on `activeProject` changes  
✅ **Added `resetOnProjectChange()` action** - Clears active board and filter when switching projects  
✅ **Auto-loads kanban data** - Automatically loads kanban when project changes  
