| `saveBoard` | 421 | Changed from `$storex.kanban.setActiveBoard(newName)` to `mutations.setActiveBoard(state, newName)` |
| `deleteBoard` | 439 | Changed from `$storex.kanban.deleteBoard(boardTitle)` to `mutations.deleteBoard(state, boardTitle)` |
| `deleteBoard` | 443 | Changed from `$storex.kanban.setActiveBoard(fallback)` to `mutations.setActiveBoard(state, fallback)` |

**Root Cause Fixed:** Eliminated infinite recursion by calling mutations directly instead of dispatching actions, which were calling themselves recursively through the `$storex` accessor.

